  "description": "Nemotron 3.5 Lightning 30B-A3B MLX inference speedup track using EigenLabs/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Lightning-30B-A3B-MLX-4bit-mtp at revision 153c469494b3f16a0eaa752dae25cfc9452ce5c6. The native MTP head is embedded in the pinned checkpoint. mtp-head.manifest.json is an optional declaration and accepts source 'pinned' only. The declaration parser accepts structural integer depths from 0 through 8. An absent spec block, disabled speculation, or depth 0 resolves to serial; disabled depth 8 also resolves to serial. An enabled positive depth must be in the fixture-permitted set 1 through 7, so enabled depth 8 is refused. The run records effective_spec and effective_mean_draft_len. Scoring is paired and single-stream: composite = prefill_gain^0.25 * decode_gain^0.75. The KV backend is contiguous. Target-model quantization and the offline transform are frozen. Ranked runs use transformed weights from the pinned reference workspace. Editable paths are listed in this manifest. docs/participant-contract.md section 5 is the authority.",
